# Copy to .env and fill in. .env is gitignored — never commit it.
#
# Optional. Both Amboss datasets used by this repo (Magma offers/orders and
# per-node fee buckets) answered unauthenticated at the last verification.
# Set a key to be a well-behaved client and to raise your rate limit.
# Obtain one at https://amboss.space -> account panel -> API Keys.
AMBOSS_API_KEY=
